.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-engine 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-engine \- Report and record which engine this binary is, against a config\*(Aqs pin
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten engine\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Report and record which engine this binary is, against a config\*(Aqs pin
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
batten\-engine\-digest(1)
Print the source digest of this tree\*(Aqs tracked engine inputs, the value a source pin names
.TP
batten\-engine\-stamp(1)
Record this tree\*(Aqs source digest beside the running binary, so a source pin can be checked
.TP
batten\-engine\-update(1)
Install the engine this config pins over the running binary, from its release or from this tree
.TP
batten\-engine\-pin(1)
Set the config\*(Aqs engine pin, or refresh a declared source pin to this tree\*(Aqs digest
.TP
batten\-engine\-gate(1)
Refuse a source pin, or a release pin that cannot load this config or lacks a verb the released lanes call
.TP
batten\-engine\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
